套餐", "One monthly plan includes a token allowance and storage in GiB. Excess storage costs $0.20/GiB per month; extra inference uses scoped credits (1 credit = $1). Automatic top-up is off." "每个月付套餐均包含 token 使用额度和以 GiB 计的存储空间。超出的存储部分每 GiB 每月收费 $0.20，额外推理则使用限定用途的 credits（1 credit = $1）。自动充值默认关闭。", "One-time" "一次性", "Purchase type" "购买类型", "Rates and how allowances work" "费率与额度说明", "Select" "选择", "Sign in" "登录", "Sign in to see your balance and purchases." "登录后即可查看余额与购买记录。", "Storage" "存储空间", "Test payments only — nothing is charged." "仅为测试付款，不会产生实际扣费。", "The free research allowance stays. Add paid capacity as you need it — no automatic top-up. USD, excluding tax." "已通过身份验证的免费研究额度保持不变。可按需添加付费额度，不会自动充值。价格以美元计，不含税。", "This plan is not purchasable yet." "此套餐暂未开放购买。", "What it covers" "包含内容"}})
